<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  ssh-tunnel-companion — LaunchAgent (Layer 2 of 3)
  ═════════════════════════════════════════════════

  PURPOSE:
    Persistent SSH tunnel to bigblack ClickHouse. Pure OpenSSH — no autossh.
    launchd KeepAlive restarts SSH when it exits (network loss, sleep/wake).
    sleepwatcher (Layer 3) kills stale SSH on wake for instant reconnection.

  3-LAYER TUNNEL RESILIENCE SYSTEM (find one → find all):
    Layer 1: SSH keepalive     — ~/.ssh/config (Host bigblack, ServerAliveInterval=30)
                                 Detects dead connections within 90s, SSH exits cleanly.
    Layer 2: launchd (THIS)    — ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.terryli.ssh-tunnel-companion.plist
                                 Restarts SSH on exit. No autossh needed.
    Layer 3: sleepwatcher      — ~/.wakeup (kills stale SSH on macOS wake)
                                 Instant recovery instead of waiting 90s for keepalive timeout.

  COMPANION FILES:
    SwiftBar plugin:  ~/Library/Application Support/SwiftBar/Plugins/ssh-tunnel.5s.sh
    Tailscale ping:   tailscale ping bigblack
    Wakeup script:    ~/.wakeup (sleepwatcher hook)
    Install script:   ~/eon/cc-skills/plugins/ssh-tunnel-companion/scripts/install.sh
    Uninstall script: ~/eon/cc-skills/plugins/ssh-tunnel-companion/scripts/uninstall.sh
    Source repo:      ~/eon/cc-skills/plugins/ssh-tunnel-companion/

  PORTS FORWARDED (SSoT is libexec/ssh-tunnel-companion-runner — this list is a
  copy; if the two ever disagree, the runner is right):
    localhost:18123 → bigblack:8123  (ClickHouse HTTP)
    localhost:18081 → bigblack:8081  (SSE sidecar — crypto ODB live bars)
    localhost:18082 → bigblack:8082  (fxview-sidecar — forex live tick SSE)
    localhost:5900  → bigblack:5900  (VNC — x11vnc, MT5/WINE on display :99)

  ⚠️ THIS TUNNEL IS LOAD-BEARING — DO NOT STOP OR UNINSTALL IT.
    A fifth forward, localhost:18095 → bigblack:8095 (ccmax-monitor dashboard
    API), was REMOVED 2026-08-15 (commit d345ddaf) because ccmax-monitor was
    decommissioned as a bigblack TENANT on 2026-07-28 and now runs on nca.
    That removal touched the runner ONLY, so this comment kept advertising the
    dead port and on 2026-09-01 nearly got the whole tunnel killed as "stale".
    The four forwards above are all still live and serve OTHER tenants
    (ODB / FXView / ClickHouse / MT5-VNC). bigblack the MACHINE is alive;
    only its ccmax tenancy ended. Scope every bigblack claim to the tenant.

  WHY NO AUTOSSH:
    With -M 0, autossh is just a wrapper that restarts SSH on exit — exactly
    what launchd KeepAlive=true does. Removing autossh eliminates a dependency
    with zero loss of functionality. Modern OpenSSH + ExitOnForwardFailure
    handles all failure detection natively.

  INSTALL:   make install   (from repo root)
  UNINSTALL: make uninstall (from repo root)

  WHY THE RUNNER (libexec/ssh-tunnel-companion-runner):
    launchd's Login Items UI displays the basename of Program — invoking
    /usr/bin/ssh directly surfaces as "ssh" in System Settings, which is
    indistinguishable from any other ssh login item. The runner exec's ssh
    so launchd's KeepAlive still operates on the real tunnel PID, and
    macOS displays "ssh-tunnel-companion-runner" instead. Port forwards
    live in the runner — single source of truth for the tunnel topology.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>Label</key>
	<string>com.terryli.ssh-tunnel-companion</string>

	<key>Program</key>
	<string>/Users/terryli/eon/cc-skills/plugins/ssh-tunnel-companion/libexec/ssh-tunnel-companion-runner</string>

	<!-- Start at login -->
	<key>RunAtLoad</key>
	<true/>

	<!-- Restart when SSH exits (dead connection, network loss, wake kill) -->
	<key>KeepAlive</key>
	<true/>

	<!-- Prevent rapid-fire reconnection on sustained outage -->
	<key>ThrottleInterval</key>
	<integer>10</integer>

	<key>StandardOutPath</key>
	<string>/tmp/ssh-tunnel-companion.log</string>
	<key>StandardErrorPath</key>
	<string>/tmp/ssh-tunnel-companion.log</string>
</dict>
</plist>
